WEBVTT

00:00:01.227 --> 00:00:02.935
[PHOENIX] A fugitive by the name
of Avery Richman has hijacked

00:00:03.018 --> 00:00:04.935
the Silver Star Express.

00:00:05.018 --> 00:00:06.227
His demand?

00:00:06.310 --> 00:00:08.102
A retrial of the American
murder case in which

00:00:08.185 --> 00:00:09.935
he was found guilty.

00:00:10.018 --> 00:00:11.477
I happened to be on this train,

00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:13.185
and have taken the role
of defense lawyer

00:00:13.268 --> 00:00:15.227
in this unprecedented trial.

00:00:15.310 --> 00:00:16.727
But in a twist of events,

00:00:16.810 --> 00:00:18.727
a passenger who could have
been a crucial witness

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:20.102
has been murdered.

00:00:20.185 --> 00:00:22.352
And what's more, his corpse
disappeared the minute

00:00:22.435 --> 00:00:23.935
we took our eyes off it.

00:01:57.310 --> 00:01:58.768
All right.

00:01:58.852 --> 00:02:01.643
Court is now back in session
for the trial of Avery Richman.

00:02:04.685 --> 00:02:06.727
There's nothing else to be said.

00:02:06.810 --> 00:02:09.477
Mr. Gale was murdered,
and he vanished.

00:02:09.560 --> 00:02:11.852
There is no other
new testimony to hear.

00:02:11.935 --> 00:02:12.935
[PHOENIX growls]

00:02:13.018 --> 00:02:14.643
[PHOENIX]
Gale was our last hope.

00:02:14.727 --> 00:02:16.727
And he's gone.

00:02:16.810 --> 00:02:20.435
[RICHMAN whimpers]

00:02:20.518 --> 00:02:23.143
How can this be happening?

00:02:23.227 --> 00:02:25.102
Oh, Mr. Richman.

00:02:26.102 --> 00:02:27.435
[GUMSHOE]
It's the cops!

00:02:27.518 --> 00:02:29.060
[MAYA]
Detective Gumshoe?

00:02:29.143 --> 00:02:30.393
[RICHMAN]
What is this?

00:02:30.477 --> 00:02:32.352
I am so sorry, my King!

00:02:32.435 --> 00:02:33.685
This man insisted. I--

00:02:33.768 --> 00:02:35.977
That's right, I know
everything that's goin' on!

00:02:36.060 --> 00:02:37.060
Know why?

00:02:37.143 --> 00:02:39.727
Because I'm a detective,
Dick Gumshoe!

00:02:39.810 --> 00:02:41.060
A policeman?

00:02:41.143 --> 00:02:43.227
[GUMSHOE] And Gale Gaelic's
body didn't vanish!

00:02:43.310 --> 00:02:44.518
Wait, did you find it?

00:02:44.602 --> 00:02:46.852
Sure did. Or, it found us!

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:52.768
Whoa! How'd it get there?

00:02:52.852 --> 00:02:54.102
What happened?

00:02:55.685 --> 00:02:57.685
Unless it teleported
somehow, I don't know.

00:02:57.768 --> 00:02:59.893
Say what? It couldn't be magic!

00:02:59.977 --> 00:03:03.268
Obviously. But the
fact is, it did show up here.

00:03:03.352 --> 00:03:04.727
Fell through the ceiling!

00:03:04.810 --> 00:03:05.810
The ceiling?

00:03:05.893 --> 00:03:07.560
Also, whaddya
mean the body vanished?

00:03:07.643 --> 00:03:08.977
You guys vanished!

00:03:09.060 --> 00:03:10.393
[MAYA]
Huh? What do you mean?

00:03:10.477 --> 00:03:11.477
We're right here.

00:03:11.560 --> 00:03:12.852
Sure, I can see
yah through the screen,

00:03:12.935 --> 00:03:15.518
but I'm in Car 3 and it's
connected to the engine!

00:03:15.602 --> 00:03:16.810
Our rooms
and the dining car

00:03:16.893 --> 00:03:18.018
completely disappeared!

00:03:18.102 --> 00:03:19.268
What? Seriously?

00:03:19.352 --> 00:03:21.352
[MAYA]
It's not like we derailed.

00:03:21.435 --> 00:03:22.852
What a night!

00:03:22.935 --> 00:03:25.143
First whole cars disappear,
then a missing corpse falls

00:03:25.227 --> 00:03:27.185
from the ceiling,
plus, that human soul.

00:03:27.268 --> 00:03:28.268
A soul?

00:03:28.352 --> 00:03:29.852
He stepping into
Maya's field of work?

00:03:29.935 --> 00:03:31.935
[MAYA]
My field is spirit channeling!

00:03:32.018 --> 00:03:33.977
I know it sounds crazy.

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:35.727
But it happened when
the lights went out.

00:03:35.810 --> 00:03:38.310
In the distance, I saw a raging
flame drifting out there

00:03:38.393 --> 00:03:39.435
in the darkness.

00:03:39.518 --> 00:03:41.310
A soul? That's rich.

00:03:41.393 --> 00:03:43.393
I saw what I saw!

00:03:43.477 --> 00:03:45.227
A flame when
the lights went out.

00:03:45.310 --> 00:03:46.643
[gasps]
Hold on a minute!

00:03:46.727 --> 00:03:48.810
There was a fire in here
when that happened!

00:03:48.893 --> 00:03:52.018
[gasps]
Yeah, he could have seen that.

00:03:52.102 --> 00:03:54.935
What? You guys saw a soul, too?

00:03:55.018 --> 00:03:58.268
No. Not a soul,
but... a birthday cake.

00:03:58.352 --> 00:04:00.685
What do you
mean a birthday cake?

00:04:00.768 --> 00:04:04.018
Your Honor. Just after 8,
a small birthday celebration

00:04:04.102 --> 00:04:05.977
was held here in the dining car.

00:04:06.060 --> 00:04:07.685
[gasping]

00:04:07.768 --> 00:04:10.227
[gasps] They're putting
on some kind of show!

00:04:11.893 --> 00:04:14.602
[MAYA squeals]
Look at the size of that thing!

00:04:14.685 --> 00:04:15.810
[BOTH chuckle]

00:04:17.935 --> 00:04:19.018
Happy birthday!

00:04:19.102 --> 00:04:21.018
I know how much you
like cake, grandma.

00:04:21.102 --> 00:04:24.018
My! Thank you so much for this.

00:04:25.393 --> 00:04:27.018
And thanks to all of you!

00:04:27.102 --> 00:04:28.435
I'm so fortunate.

00:04:28.518 --> 00:04:32.060
I've made it to 87 and
still get a birthday cake!

00:04:32.143 --> 00:04:34.393
Look at that! It's so pretty!

00:04:34.477 --> 00:04:37.643
[applause]

00:04:41.602 --> 00:04:44.143
--[JAM] O-Oh!
--[PASSENGERS gasping]

00:04:44.227 --> 00:04:46.435
Oh, no! Get a fire extinguisher!

00:04:51.518 --> 00:04:52.435
[crashing]

00:04:52.518 --> 00:04:53.727
What was that?!

00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:55.643
Yes. I remember the bump.

00:04:55.727 --> 00:04:57.602
A "raging flame in the dark."

00:04:57.685 --> 00:05:00.185
That fire was big enough
to be seen at a distance.

00:05:00.268 --> 00:05:01.685
Ridiculous!

00:05:01.768 --> 00:05:04.518
How could he have seen a fire in
the dining car from Car 3?

00:05:04.602 --> 00:05:05.935
[PHOENIX]
I'm getting to that.

00:05:06.018 --> 00:05:08.435
If what Dick says is true,
what he saw could explain

00:05:08.518 --> 00:05:10.685
the disappearance
of our cars, as well.

00:05:10.768 --> 00:05:12.143
Then please, continue.

00:05:12.227 --> 00:05:14.102
It's not that the cars vanished.

00:05:14.185 --> 00:05:15.810
It's that they were rearranged.

00:05:15.893 --> 00:05:17.810
[JUDGE]
What? Rearranged?

00:05:17.893 --> 00:05:20.435
[PHOENIX] This railroad used
to be a small local line.

00:05:20.518 --> 00:05:22.852
And the old freight stations
that were used for transporting

00:05:22.935 --> 00:05:26.227
lumber still dot the tracks.

00:05:26.310 --> 00:05:27.935
First, the lights
were turned off,

00:05:28.018 --> 00:05:29.768
making it impossible
for us to see what was

00:05:29.852 --> 00:05:32.393
about to happen to us.

00:05:32.477 --> 00:05:34.977
Second, the train was
slowed down before it reached

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:37.268
a predetermined junction.

00:05:37.352 --> 00:05:41.018
And the couplings in front of
Cars 1 and 3 were disconnected.

00:05:47.435 --> 00:05:49.643
[MAYA]
The train split up!

00:05:49.727 --> 00:05:51.810
[PHOENIX] This was when
the fire broke out,

00:05:51.893 --> 00:05:54.102
and that's what Gumshoe saw.

00:05:54.185 --> 00:05:57.268
Our cars running along
a parallel freight line.

00:05:57.352 --> 00:05:58.810
And then...

00:05:58.893 --> 00:06:01.643
By no small coincidence, we
ended up behind the third car.

00:06:01.727 --> 00:06:03.810
So when we all
reached the junction...

00:06:09.727 --> 00:06:11.310
[MAYA]
We switched places!

00:06:11.393 --> 00:06:14.268
Finally, the Silver Star
came to a halt.

00:06:14.352 --> 00:06:16.768
But why? Other than
to let you board this train,

00:06:16.852 --> 00:06:19.185
there was one other
reason for the standstill.

00:06:19.268 --> 00:06:20.727
Am I on the right track?

00:06:27.227 --> 00:06:28.727
Yes.

00:06:28.810 --> 00:06:30.643
We needed to stop to reconnect
the couplings between the cars,

00:06:30.727 --> 00:06:32.352
as you surmised.

00:06:32.435 --> 00:06:34.560
I'm deeply impressed
by your deductive skills.

00:06:34.643 --> 00:06:36.602
I knew I picked
the right lawyer.

00:06:36.685 --> 00:06:38.643
Wait, you really
rearranged the cars?!

00:06:38.727 --> 00:06:41.643
That's nuts.
Why do something so crazy?

00:06:41.727 --> 00:06:44.060
You'll find out soon.

00:06:44.143 --> 00:06:45.935
Just the whim of a rich man?

00:06:46.018 --> 00:06:47.977
I knew it would be
something asinine.

00:06:51.310 --> 00:06:53.893
Well. That asinine
decision helps us.

00:06:53.977 --> 00:06:55.518
What do you mean?

00:06:55.602 --> 00:06:57.602
[PHOENIX]
Thanks to the shuffle.

00:06:57.685 --> 00:07:00.185
I've identified who killed Gale.

00:07:00.268 --> 00:07:03.060
[gasps]

00:07:03.143 --> 00:07:04.977
And that is?

00:07:05.060 --> 00:07:07.060
Can't you figure it
out yourself?

00:07:07.143 --> 00:07:09.810
If the body before
Gumshoe is the real Gale,

00:07:09.893 --> 00:07:12.435
then the only possible
explanation is the one we saw

00:07:12.518 --> 00:07:14.602
before was actually a fake.

00:07:14.685 --> 00:07:15.643
[MAYA gasps]

00:07:15.727 --> 00:07:17.393
Gale died in Car 3.

00:07:17.477 --> 00:07:19.268
And... the killer
hid his body in

00:07:19.352 --> 00:07:21.393
the ceiling where it
shouldn't have been found!

00:07:21.477 --> 00:07:24.102
Wait, we're standing
in a crime scene?

00:07:25.435 --> 00:07:27.185
[REGINA] The only reason the
corpse fell out of the ceiling

00:07:27.268 --> 00:07:29.518
is 'cause of that
lightning strike.

00:07:29.602 --> 00:07:30.935
That makes sense.

00:07:31.018 --> 00:07:33.227
And I'm sure the killer didn't
expect that to happen.

00:07:34.518 --> 00:07:35.602
[GUMSHOE]
So then...

00:07:35.685 --> 00:07:38.935
When exactly was
this man murdered?

00:07:39.018 --> 00:07:40.435
Good question.

00:07:40.518 --> 00:07:43.018
It had to have been before
the cars were rearranged,

00:07:43.102 --> 00:07:44.143
most likely.

00:07:44.227 --> 00:07:47.268
No way! I've been here
the entire time!

00:07:50.893 --> 00:07:52.477
There was a period
when nobody was

00:07:52.560 --> 00:07:53.935
in the car, remember?

00:07:55.602 --> 00:07:57.518
That's right! Dinnertime!

00:07:57.602 --> 00:07:58.518
Yeah!

00:07:58.602 --> 00:08:00.102
Of course!

00:08:00.185 --> 00:08:02.977
If they did it during dinner,
nobody'd be there to see it!

00:08:03.060 --> 00:08:05.060
[RICHMAN] So, you mean
to say the corpse we saw

00:08:05.143 --> 00:08:06.643
in Car 1 was...

00:08:06.727 --> 00:08:08.143
[PHOENIX]
A phony.

00:08:08.227 --> 00:08:10.602
Gale had already been murdered
and hidden in the ceiling

00:08:10.685 --> 00:08:11.935
by the time we found it.

00:08:12.018 --> 00:08:13.393
All right.

00:08:13.477 --> 00:08:15.602
I'm with you this far, but I
can think of one problem.

00:08:15.685 --> 00:08:18.102
The victim was a Car 1
passenger, and nobody

00:08:18.185 --> 00:08:20.727
passed through the dining
car while we were eating.

00:08:20.810 --> 00:08:23.393
[PHOENIX] Still, Gale and the
killer must have met there.

00:08:23.477 --> 00:08:26.893
[TRISTAN] Nonsense. This court
requires facts, not conjecture.

00:08:26.977 --> 00:08:29.227
Now, is there anyone who can
testify the victim went through

00:08:29.310 --> 00:08:31.477
the dining car around
the suggested time?

00:08:31.560 --> 00:08:32.477
[gasping]

00:08:32.560 --> 00:08:34.852
[CYLINDER growls]

00:08:34.935 --> 00:08:36.643
Man. I can't blame 'em.

00:08:36.727 --> 00:08:39.352
Nobody would remember everyone
they passed on the train.

00:08:39.435 --> 00:08:41.310
If you asked me,
I'd say I dunno!

00:08:41.393 --> 00:08:43.768
[PHOENIX] But in this case, just
pointing out the possibility

00:08:43.852 --> 00:08:45.935
will be enough, because...

00:08:46.018 --> 00:08:47.685
It's clear that there
is only one person

00:08:47.768 --> 00:08:48.685
who could have done this!

00:08:48.768 --> 00:08:50.560
Well? Who is it?

00:08:50.643 --> 00:08:52.227
Who are you accusing?

00:08:52.310 --> 00:08:56.018
The killer... is you!

00:08:56.102 --> 00:08:57.685
Tristan Turnbull!

00:09:01.227 --> 00:09:03.768
The killer is Mr. Turnbull?

00:09:03.852 --> 00:09:05.352
How could that be?

00:09:05.435 --> 00:09:08.268
[TRISTAN sighs]
This isn't even worth arguing.

00:09:08.352 --> 00:09:10.018
[PHOENIX]
It could only have been you.

00:09:10.102 --> 00:09:11.268
After hearing the scream,

00:09:11.352 --> 00:09:13.727
I ran to the room and
then put out the fire.

00:09:13.810 --> 00:09:15.768
Soon after, the body
disappeared.

00:09:15.852 --> 00:09:17.143
That's all I know.

00:09:18.768 --> 00:09:20.435
But that corpse
we found wasn't Gale.

00:09:20.518 --> 00:09:21.685
[gasps]

00:09:21.768 --> 00:09:23.977
[PHOENIX] In fact,
that guy wasn't even dead!

00:09:24.060 --> 00:09:24.852
No way!

00:09:24.935 --> 00:09:26.810
How could he have been alive?

00:09:26.893 --> 00:09:29.518
[PHOENIX] Someone dressed like
the victim and played dead.

00:09:29.602 --> 00:09:31.227
In other words, your accomplice!

00:09:31.310 --> 00:09:32.685
[TRISTAN growls]

00:09:32.768 --> 00:09:35.560
[PHOENIX] A partner-in-crime
would explain everything.

00:09:35.643 --> 00:09:38.602
You were the one who
checked the body back then.

00:09:38.685 --> 00:09:41.143
You didn't let us get close to
it and then closed the door

00:09:41.227 --> 00:09:44.352
behind you to "preserve
the crime scene."

00:09:44.435 --> 00:09:47.018
While you were buying
time for him by the door.

00:09:47.102 --> 00:09:49.143
The "corpse" took off
the victim's clothes

00:09:49.227 --> 00:09:52.060
and stashed them away for later.

00:09:52.143 --> 00:09:54.727
Then, they hid themselves
behind the door.

00:09:54.810 --> 00:09:56.893
What?

00:09:56.977 --> 00:09:58.352
[gasps]
No!

00:09:58.435 --> 00:10:00.227
[PHOENIX] When Mr. Richman
eventually opened the door,

00:10:00.310 --> 00:10:02.227
the body appeared to be gone.

00:10:02.310 --> 00:10:04.977
And while we stood there
shocked, unbeknownst to us,

00:10:05.060 --> 00:10:07.352
the double snuck out
from behind the door.

00:10:07.435 --> 00:10:09.352
But... that is such a cliché!

00:10:09.435 --> 00:10:11.393
And just who
was this accomplice?

00:10:11.477 --> 00:10:12.727
Funny enough.

00:10:12.810 --> 00:10:14.393
There was someone who
wasn't nearby when we were

00:10:14.477 --> 00:10:16.852
in the hallway,
but suddenly appeared

00:10:16.935 --> 00:10:19.477
as soon as we went inside.

00:10:19.560 --> 00:10:20.685
And that someone...

00:10:20.768 --> 00:10:21.935
...is you!

00:10:22.018 --> 00:10:23.477
Rick, Is this all true?

00:10:23.560 --> 00:10:25.435
[RICK gasps]

00:10:27.143 --> 00:10:28.393
[PHOENIX]
Rick?

00:10:28.477 --> 00:10:29.935
I was wondering if
there was anything I could do

00:10:30.018 --> 00:10:31.185
to help you guys.

00:10:31.268 --> 00:10:32.518
Wait, it was him?

00:10:32.602 --> 00:10:34.185
How could you, Rick?

00:10:34.268 --> 00:10:35.893
Why would you do this?

00:10:37.852 --> 00:10:39.310
[RICK]
I'm terribly sorry, King.

00:10:39.393 --> 00:10:42.685
But... I've been cooperating
with American law enforcement

00:10:42.768 --> 00:10:44.018
since a year ago.

00:10:44.102 --> 00:10:45.102
That explains it.

00:10:45.185 --> 00:10:47.518
An entire year? Then...

00:10:47.602 --> 00:10:48.977
This fool.

00:10:49.060 --> 00:10:51.018
I was offered
a large sum of money.

00:10:51.102 --> 00:10:54.268
All I had to do procure a gun
with your fingerprints on it.

00:10:54.352 --> 00:10:56.643
The gun? From the first trial!

00:10:56.727 --> 00:10:57.893
That's right.

00:10:57.977 --> 00:11:01.560
I followed orders,
and a few days later,

00:11:01.643 --> 00:11:04.352
Secretary General Cashanova
was shot at the ceremony

00:11:04.435 --> 00:11:06.643
and you were arrested!

00:11:06.727 --> 00:11:09.185
Then that whole murder
was a setup to frame me?

00:11:09.268 --> 00:11:12.060
A man was killed so that I would
be out of their hair?

00:11:12.143 --> 00:11:14.310
Yes, and the one
who really shot Cashanova

00:11:14.393 --> 00:11:16.018
was Gale Gaelic.

00:11:16.102 --> 00:11:18.518
He fired from
near you on purpose.

00:11:18.602 --> 00:11:20.977
And then the policemen who
frisked you planted the evidence

00:11:21.060 --> 00:11:22.602
in your coat pocket.

00:11:22.685 --> 00:11:24.435
They claimed the pistol
I stole for them was

00:11:24.518 --> 00:11:26.685
the murder weapon,
but it wasn't.

00:11:29.227 --> 00:11:30.602
That can't be!

00:11:30.685 --> 00:11:33.643
The US Prosecutor's Office
conspired against him?

00:11:33.727 --> 00:11:35.310
What do you have
to say for yourself?

00:11:37.852 --> 00:11:39.810
I am so, so sorry.

00:11:39.893 --> 00:11:42.352
I just couldn't bring
myself to tell you.

00:11:42.435 --> 00:11:43.852
A year later.

00:11:43.935 --> 00:11:48.227
And you were once again ordered
to cooperate, by Turnbull.

00:11:48.310 --> 00:11:51.310
[RICK] Yes. It was after
we hijacked the train,

00:11:51.393 --> 00:11:54.852
and before the trial began.

00:11:54.935 --> 00:11:57.310
He told me to do as he
said if I didn't want the King

00:11:57.393 --> 00:11:59.185
to find out I betrayed him.

00:12:00.310 --> 00:12:02.893
It was before the trail began?

00:12:02.977 --> 00:12:04.560
Right! Then!

00:12:04.643 --> 00:12:07.977
[TRISTAN] Give me 20 minutes.
I'll need to prepare.

00:12:08.060 --> 00:12:09.810
[PHOENIX]
And "prepare" you did.

00:12:09.893 --> 00:12:12.602
You formulated a plan,
approached Rick, and forced him

00:12:12.685 --> 00:12:14.102
to help you pull it off!

00:12:14.185 --> 00:12:15.560
Then that means...

00:12:15.643 --> 00:12:18.602
...Wright's theory about the
missing corpse was right.

00:12:18.685 --> 00:12:20.518
I wonder, do you have
any concrete proof

00:12:20.602 --> 00:12:21.852
I cut a deal with Rick?

00:12:21.935 --> 00:12:23.393
Well... Not concrete.

00:12:23.477 --> 00:12:24.977
Of course you don't.

00:12:25.060 --> 00:12:27.643
Besides, what motivation would
I have to kill this Gale person

00:12:27.727 --> 00:12:28.643
in the first place?

00:12:28.727 --> 00:12:29.977
[PHOENIX grunts]

00:12:30.060 --> 00:12:32.143
[TRISTAN] I had absolutely
nothing to do with him.

00:12:32.227 --> 00:12:35.352
What's more, I have nothing to
do with this bizarre conspiracy

00:12:35.435 --> 00:12:37.143
theory that fugitive
has cooked up

00:12:37.227 --> 00:12:39.102
in his twisted little head.

00:12:39.185 --> 00:12:39.977
[PHOENIX growls]

00:12:40.060 --> 00:12:41.102
Heh.

00:12:42.727 --> 00:12:44.268
[MILES]
That's not going to fly.

00:12:44.352 --> 00:12:45.393
[TRISTAN gasps]

00:12:49.018 --> 00:12:50.352
Him?

00:12:50.435 --> 00:12:51.518
It's Miles!

00:12:51.602 --> 00:12:53.060
What a surprise!

00:12:53.143 --> 00:12:55.227
It's been quite
some time, Turnbull.

00:12:55.310 --> 00:12:57.518
Edgeworth!
What's the meaning of this?

00:12:57.602 --> 00:12:58.977
So, you know each other?

00:12:59.060 --> 00:13:02.102
I have in my possession
Avery Richman's court record.

00:13:02.185 --> 00:13:04.310
Your name appears
within its pages.

00:13:04.393 --> 00:13:05.727
What?

00:13:05.810 --> 00:13:07.352
[MILES] In charge of building
the prosecution's case:

00:13:07.435 --> 00:13:08.602
Tristan Turnbull.

00:13:08.685 --> 00:13:12.143
So, a year ago. It was all you?

00:13:12.227 --> 00:13:13.935
[MILES] Now you can't
hide behind the excuse

00:13:14.018 --> 00:13:16.185
you were unrelated
to the previous trial.

00:13:16.268 --> 00:13:17.518
Why, you--

00:13:17.602 --> 00:13:19.727
[MILES] Unfortunately...
There's more in here, too.

00:13:19.810 --> 00:13:22.227
According to the record, one
year ago, there was a witness

00:13:22.310 --> 00:13:24.810
whose summons was
canceled by you personally.

00:13:24.893 --> 00:13:28.143
That witness's
name was Gale Gaelic!

00:13:28.227 --> 00:13:29.560
It was Gale?

00:13:29.643 --> 00:13:31.518
The current trial has
made it perfectly clear

00:13:31.602 --> 00:13:33.560
that he was quite
the crucial witness.

00:13:33.643 --> 00:13:35.935
So why, then, did you
deliberately avoid calling him

00:13:36.018 --> 00:13:37.102
to the stand?

00:13:37.185 --> 00:13:38.727
I simply concluded
that he wasn't important

00:13:38.810 --> 00:13:40.352
to the original trial!

00:13:40.435 --> 00:13:41.810
Interesting word choice.

00:13:41.893 --> 00:13:44.602
Are you trying to say that
you're simply incompetent?

00:13:44.685 --> 00:13:45.602
[TRISTAN growls]

00:13:45.685 --> 00:13:47.102
I see.

00:13:47.185 --> 00:13:49.602
Calling that witness would have
spelled disaster for him.

00:13:49.685 --> 00:13:51.727
I can't think of
any other reason for it.

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:53.268
[PHOENIX] He was afraid
of the truth coming out

00:13:53.352 --> 00:13:55.268
in the trial a year ago.

00:13:55.352 --> 00:13:56.727
Tristan...

00:13:56.810 --> 00:13:59.518
That proves you were at the
center of the conspiracy!

00:13:59.602 --> 00:14:01.768
During the first trial,
you never actually set foot

00:14:01.852 --> 00:14:03.310
in court yourself.

00:14:03.393 --> 00:14:05.810
But behind the scenes, you laid
the groundwork to entangle

00:14:05.893 --> 00:14:08.810
Mr. Richman in a web of lies.

00:14:08.893 --> 00:14:12.102
[squeals] These two are working
together across the Pacific!

00:14:12.185 --> 00:14:13.435
So cool, man!

00:14:13.518 --> 00:14:15.768
[CHIEF PROSECUTOR]
You disappoint me, Turnbull.

00:14:15.852 --> 00:14:19.143
[TRISTAN gasps]
Chief?

00:14:19.227 --> 00:14:20.227
And who's that?

00:14:20.310 --> 00:14:21.685
The chief prosecutor.

00:14:21.768 --> 00:14:24.602
The man at the very top of
America's justice system.

00:14:24.685 --> 00:14:26.477
[CHIEF PROSECUTOR] Our courts
are built on the foundation

00:14:26.560 --> 00:14:29.227
of pursuing justice and
doing the right thing.

00:14:29.310 --> 00:14:32.560
And yet, you've dragged those
principles through the mud.

00:14:32.643 --> 00:14:34.435
You will be
punished accordingly.

00:14:34.518 --> 00:14:35.935
Hold on a moment!

00:14:36.018 --> 00:14:38.018
I was told to convict Richman
so he could be thrown

00:14:38.102 --> 00:14:39.435
out of the country!

00:14:39.518 --> 00:14:41.977
I only did what the
top brass ordered me to!

00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:43.643
And that's the problem.

00:14:43.727 --> 00:14:46.977
A fool who would follow unjust
orders to please a superior

00:14:47.060 --> 00:14:49.143
has no place in our system.

00:14:49.227 --> 00:14:51.102
Funny that you
mention your superior.

00:14:51.185 --> 00:14:52.352
We spoke to him not long ago,

00:14:52.435 --> 00:14:55.102
and he confessed with
little provocation.

00:14:55.185 --> 00:14:57.143
He admitted to collusion
and conspiring with

00:14:57.227 --> 00:15:00.727
the Commerce Council, who wanted
rid of Cashanova altogether.

00:15:00.810 --> 00:15:02.518
--Correct?
--He confessed?

00:15:02.602 --> 00:15:05.143
[MILES] Gale Gaelic, who you
refused to bring to the stand,

00:15:05.227 --> 00:15:07.435
was an assassin
hired by the council!

00:15:07.518 --> 00:15:09.143
What? An assassin?

00:15:09.227 --> 00:15:11.352
There was no justice
in this deal.

00:15:11.435 --> 00:15:13.560
There was, however,
blood money to be made.

00:15:13.643 --> 00:15:14.977
[TRISTAN]
I-I didn't know!

00:15:15.060 --> 00:15:17.727
[MILES] Regardless, you played
a part in a conspiracy.

00:15:17.810 --> 00:15:19.810
You, sir, clearly broke the law!

00:15:19.893 --> 00:15:23.352
[PHOENIX] Mr. Turnbull, you
have no right to judge anyone.

00:15:23.435 --> 00:15:24.893
You might as well admit it!

00:15:24.977 --> 00:15:26.393
You're an enemy of justice!

00:15:26.477 --> 00:15:28.435
[yells]

00:15:31.727 --> 00:15:32.352
[TRISTAN whimpers]

00:15:32.435 --> 00:15:34.602
[train whistle blows]

00:15:34.685 --> 00:15:35.935
One year ago,

00:15:36.018 --> 00:15:39.060
I came to believe that
you were my enemy.

00:15:39.143 --> 00:15:41.893
But it seems I was mistaken.

00:15:41.977 --> 00:15:43.143
[CHIEF PROSECUTOR]
Hmm.

00:15:45.102 --> 00:15:45.893
[PHOENIX]
Now tell us...

00:15:45.977 --> 00:15:48.227
--What?
--...everything.

00:15:48.310 --> 00:15:51.602
Very well, then.
It was soon after we departed.

00:15:54.643 --> 00:15:56.518
[TRISTAN]
You were invited, too?

00:15:56.602 --> 00:15:58.602
I was just as surprised.

00:15:59.977 --> 00:16:03.602
But. Somehow, I sense
the hand of God behind this.

00:16:03.685 --> 00:16:04.935
What does that mean?

00:16:05.018 --> 00:16:08.143
This whole year,
a thought never left my mind.

00:16:08.227 --> 00:16:11.852
A nagging feeling that I wasn't
given enough hush money.

00:16:11.935 --> 00:16:13.268
Wouldn't you agree?

00:16:13.352 --> 00:16:14.852
Are you threatening me?

00:16:14.935 --> 00:16:17.143
Being an assassin is
taxing work.

00:16:17.227 --> 00:16:20.518
And I've considered switching to
blackmail, so why not start now?

00:16:20.602 --> 00:16:23.060
It is a lucrative business.

00:16:23.143 --> 00:16:27.352
[TRISTAN] Like him, I, too,
felt the hand of God at play.

00:16:27.435 --> 00:16:30.435
It was the perfect
chance to silence him forever.

00:16:30.518 --> 00:16:31.685
So I took it.

00:16:31.768 --> 00:16:34.935
Then let's talk.
Car 3 should be empty right now.

00:16:35.018 --> 00:16:36.852
We'll take this
conversation there.

00:16:36.935 --> 00:16:37.810
[MAYA hums]

00:16:37.893 --> 00:16:39.310
[TRISTAN]
It was around 6 PM.

00:16:39.393 --> 00:16:41.602
We went at a time when lots
of people would be going in

00:16:41.685 --> 00:16:43.352
and out of the dining car.

00:16:43.435 --> 00:16:46.102
Which helped divert
any unwanted attention from us.

00:16:46.185 --> 00:16:48.060
And we easily made
it to Car 3.

00:16:49.768 --> 00:16:53.518
[TRISTAN] Then... In one of
the Car 3 compartments,

00:16:53.602 --> 00:16:55.435
I put a knife in his chest.

00:16:56.685 --> 00:16:59.518
Yikes. I think it was my room.

00:16:59.602 --> 00:17:04.435
[PHOENIX] Finally. You hid
the body in the hallway ceiling.

00:17:04.518 --> 00:17:06.727
[TRISTAN] But... I never
could have foreseen

00:17:06.810 --> 00:17:08.977
what was about to
happen on this train.

00:17:09.060 --> 00:17:12.018
We were hijacked,
and all forced into a trial.

00:17:12.102 --> 00:17:13.935
[TRISTAN] If anyone
realized he was missing,

00:17:14.018 --> 00:17:15.268
the train would be
searched and the body

00:17:15.352 --> 00:17:17.143
would quickly be found.

00:17:17.227 --> 00:17:18.893
I had to prevent
that from happening!

00:17:18.977 --> 00:17:21.810
So you put on a fanciful
show of the body disappearing

00:17:21.893 --> 00:17:24.018
in front of people who
could vouch for it.

00:17:24.102 --> 00:17:25.893
It was a bid to buy myself time!

00:17:25.977 --> 00:17:27.727
When we arrived,
the room was in flames.

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:30.477
What part of your
plan was that exactly?

00:17:30.560 --> 00:17:32.685
I ordered Rick
to set fire to it just before

00:17:32.768 --> 00:17:34.102
he would be found.

00:17:38.060 --> 00:17:39.685
[TRISTAN] It was to make
sure nobody approached him

00:17:39.768 --> 00:17:40.893
before I did.

00:17:44.518 --> 00:17:45.560
[CYLINDER growls]

00:17:45.643 --> 00:17:46.602
[BOTH gasp]

00:17:48.893 --> 00:17:50.352
Damn you, Miles.

00:17:50.435 --> 00:17:52.893
I've always hated
that look in your eyes.

00:17:52.977 --> 00:17:55.102
It was to escape your
gaze that I went to America

00:17:55.185 --> 00:17:56.393
to begin with.

00:17:56.477 --> 00:17:58.102
The problem here lies with you.

00:17:58.185 --> 00:18:00.102
And you can't
escape from yourself.

00:18:00.185 --> 00:18:01.143
[TRISTAN sighs]

00:18:02.435 --> 00:18:03.768
I've heard enough!

00:18:03.852 --> 00:18:05.393
Train crew, if you will.

00:18:05.477 --> 00:18:07.018
Please restrain Tristan Turnbull

00:18:07.102 --> 00:18:09.102
and his confessed
accomplice, Rick.

00:18:09.185 --> 00:18:10.685
We'll turn them in later.

00:18:12.893 --> 00:18:14.810
Thanks for all your help, Miles.

00:18:14.893 --> 00:18:16.810
You worked fast.

00:18:16.893 --> 00:18:19.018
We had to find the truth.

00:18:19.102 --> 00:18:21.935
I shall hereby hand
down the final verdict!

00:18:22.018 --> 00:18:23.185
[MAYA giggles]

00:18:24.727 --> 00:18:26.727
Not guilty!

00:18:26.810 --> 00:18:28.768
[alarm blares]

00:18:28.852 --> 00:18:29.935
What-- An alarm?

00:18:30.018 --> 00:18:31.685
Everyone,
I ask you to remain calm,

00:18:31.768 --> 00:18:33.768
but please leave
this car at once.

00:18:33.852 --> 00:18:35.977
In three minutes.
A bomb I have planted

00:18:36.060 --> 00:18:37.518
will blow it sky high.

00:18:38.893 --> 00:18:40.852
--A bomb?!
--[wails]

00:18:40.935 --> 00:18:43.310
Not even I can
stop it at this point.

00:18:43.393 --> 00:18:47.768
[gasping]

00:18:47.852 --> 00:18:49.143
What are you waiting for?

00:18:49.227 --> 00:18:53.977
Listen, Mr. Wright.
You have my deepest gratitude.

00:18:54.060 --> 00:18:56.102
But as one who defiled
the Richman name,

00:18:56.185 --> 00:18:58.227
I can live on no longer.

00:18:58.310 --> 00:18:59.518
I don't understand,

00:18:59.602 --> 00:19:01.310
were you planning for this
to happen all along?

00:19:01.393 --> 00:19:03.935
[RICHMAN] Whether the retrial
declared me innocent or guilty,

00:19:04.018 --> 00:19:06.352
it wouldn't change anything
in the eyes of the law.

00:19:06.435 --> 00:19:09.185
Beyond the confines of
the train, I'm still a fugitive.

00:19:09.268 --> 00:19:11.810
So I set a time bomb
in this car just in case.

00:19:11.893 --> 00:19:14.268
Huh? Just in case of what?

00:19:14.352 --> 00:19:15.643
I see.

00:19:15.727 --> 00:19:17.560
So that's the reason you
risked rearranging the order

00:19:17.643 --> 00:19:19.935
of the train to put
the dining car at the rear.

00:19:20.018 --> 00:19:21.977
So that you could
disconnect its coupling...

00:19:22.060 --> 00:19:23.268
...and die alone!

00:19:23.352 --> 00:19:24.643
[PHOENIX]
He what?

00:19:24.727 --> 00:19:27.185
[RICHMAN] Hm. I fear I could
never hope to outsmart

00:19:27.268 --> 00:19:28.852
either of you.

00:19:28.935 --> 00:19:30.935
Hurry up, and leave, now!

00:19:32.477 --> 00:19:33.727
[yelling]

00:19:36.435 --> 00:19:38.643
We all know that the
initial verdict was a mistake!

00:19:38.727 --> 00:19:40.268
So why are you doing this?

00:19:40.352 --> 00:19:42.227
America's justice
system is perfect!

00:19:42.310 --> 00:19:44.768
No matter what happens,
that will never change!

00:19:44.852 --> 00:19:46.518
Yes. That's the problem.

00:19:46.602 --> 00:19:48.477
They will never
admit their mistake.

00:19:48.560 --> 00:19:49.727
[PHOENIX]
Objection!

00:19:49.810 --> 00:19:51.477
I believed in you before.

00:19:51.560 --> 00:19:54.060
Now you need to return
the favor and believe in us!

00:19:54.143 --> 00:19:55.143
[RICHMAN gasps]

00:19:55.227 --> 00:19:58.227
You misunderstand
how the law works!

00:19:58.310 --> 00:20:00.227
[CHIEF PROSECUTOR]
Yes. Our justice system

00:20:00.310 --> 00:20:02.268
must always be perfect.

00:20:02.352 --> 00:20:04.602
And to accomplish that,
we will correct any mistakes

00:20:04.685 --> 00:20:05.768
we have made.

00:20:05.852 --> 00:20:08.310
Chief Prosecutor.

00:20:08.393 --> 00:20:10.518
You have my sincerest apologies.

00:20:10.602 --> 00:20:12.310
We have wronged you.

00:20:12.393 --> 00:20:13.727
I give you my word.

00:20:13.810 --> 00:20:16.768
We will give you
an honest, fair retrial.

00:20:16.852 --> 00:20:18.810
Of course. It'll all be public.

00:20:18.893 --> 00:20:20.893
[gasps]

00:20:20.977 --> 00:20:22.185
Aww, I'm so glad!

00:20:22.268 --> 00:20:23.518
Me, too!

00:20:23.602 --> 00:20:25.768
I have a feeling Edgeworth
talked him into that.

00:20:25.852 --> 00:20:27.352
Now, we save him.

00:20:27.435 --> 00:20:30.143
Roger! I hope you're ready to
spring into action, Vanguard!

00:20:30.227 --> 00:20:32.685
[GUMSHOE]
You got it! I'm at the controls!

00:20:38.102 --> 00:20:39.435
We're catching up!

00:20:39.518 --> 00:20:40.810
'Kay. Come on!

00:20:42.393 --> 00:20:43.393
[MAYA grunts]

00:20:50.602 --> 00:20:52.643
Clear! Full speed ahead!

00:20:52.727 --> 00:20:55.143
Roger that! Max speed comin' up!

00:20:55.227 --> 00:20:56.643
[groans]

00:21:13.643 --> 00:21:15.227
[gasps]
Check it out!

00:21:15.310 --> 00:21:18.810
Hey! First of the year.

00:21:19.768 --> 00:21:23.477
[RICHMAN] How beautiful.
What an incredible sunrise.

00:21:23.560 --> 00:21:25.393
I have never seen one better.

00:21:25.477 --> 00:21:27.518
Yeah. Me, either.

00:21:27.602 --> 00:21:28.727
Wow.

00:21:31.268 --> 00:21:34.185
Today, you embark
on a brand new journey.

00:21:34.268 --> 00:21:35.393
[RICHMAN]
Hmm.

00:21:37.268 --> 00:21:39.768
[GUMSHOE sobs]

00:23:20.060 --> 00:23:21.393
[PHOENIX]
Objection!

00:23:21.477 --> 00:23:23.602
Five years ago, before
I was an attorney,

00:23:23.685 --> 00:23:26.143
I took to the courtroom
for a different reason.

00:23:26.227 --> 00:23:28.560
Back then... I was the
accused in a murder case.

00:23:28.643 --> 00:23:31.935
And that case was the
reason I first met Mia.

00:23:32.018 --> 00:23:33.935
She was still a rookie
attorney at the time,

00:23:34.018 --> 00:23:37.393
and the two of us faced off
against a terrifying incident.

00:23:37.477 --> 00:23:39.185
But we would soon find
out that even bigger

00:23:39.268 --> 00:23:41.352
shadows loomed behind it.

00:23:41.435 --> 00:23:43.893
Find the contradictions!
Believe in the truth!

00:23:43.977 --> 00:23:47.185
Next episode, a one-hour
special: "Turnabout Memories"!

00:23:47.268 --> 00:23:48.518
Take that!
